---
const pageTitle = "Theos's Tools | Unity Developer Toolkit | TheosDev";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>{pageTitle}</title>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js" is:inline></script>
    <style>
      body { background-color: #0f1115; color: #e2e8f0; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
      .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px; }
      .back-btn { display: inline-block; color: #00e676; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 40px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
      .back-btn:hover { transform: translateX(-5px); }
      .project-header { margin-bottom: 50px; opacity: 0; }
      h1 { font-size: 3.5rem; color: #f8fafc; margin: 0 0 10px 0; }
      .subtitle { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #94a3b8; }
      .content-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 60px; opacity: 0; }
      @media (max-width: 768px) { .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
      h2 { color: #00e676; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,230,118,0.2); padding-bottom: 10px; margin-top: 30px; }
      ul { padding-left: 20px; }
      li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
      .tech-sidebar { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); height: fit-content; }
      .tech-item { margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .tech-item h4 { margin: 0 0 5px 0; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.9rem; text-transform: uppercase;}
      .tech-item p { margin: 0; color: #f8fafc; font-weight: bold; }
      .badge { display: inline-block; background: rgba(0, 230, 118, 0.2); color: #00e676; border: 1px solid #00e676; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>

    <div class="container">
      <a href="/en/projects" class="back-btn">← Back to Projects</a>

      <div class="project-header anim-element">
        <span class="badge">Unity Editor Package</span>
        <h1>Theos's Tools</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">11-Module Unity Editor Extension & Rapid Prototyping Suite</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content-grid anim-element">
        
        <div class="main-content">
          <h2>Package Modules</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Brainstorm Canvas:</strong> Node-based editor window for visualizing story arcs and system dependencies directly in Unity.</li>
            <li><strong>Gamepad Integrator:</strong> Bridges keyboard input scripts to Unity New Input System gamepad controls automatically.</li>
            <li><strong>Save Data Surgeon & Localization Hub:</strong> In-editor JSON/DAT save inspector and Excel-like multi-language string manager.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="tech-sidebar">
          <h3>Technical Overview</h3>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Developer</h4><p>Nazım Beyaz (Solo)</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Engine</h4><p>Unity3D (C# Editor Scripting)</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Modules</h4><p>11 Integrated Utilities</p></div>
          <div class="tech-item"><h4>Status</h4><p>Completed Unity Package</p></div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <script is:inline>
      document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
        gsap.to(".anim-element", { opacity: 1, y: -20, duration: 1, stagger: 0.2, ease: "power3.out" });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>